     mmooppcchhkk shows information about which devices are known, version of mopd
     suite or information about a MOP-image.

     If _f_i_l_e is given, information about the MOP-image is read from the header
     of the file.

     The options are as follows:

     --aa      Show all the Ethernets attached to the system.

